{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"c71c20f4d63a28829bad75e93ad858a322dc4ffcbe1d504342fa88f19253826f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶穌超越摩西"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["因此，同蒙天召的聖潔弟兄姊妹，你們應當仔細思想那位我們公認為特使和大祭司的耶穌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["祂向委任祂的上帝盡忠，就好像摩西向上帝的全家盡忠一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["然而祂卻比摩西配得更大的榮耀，就好像建造房子的人比房子更尊貴一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為房子都是人建造的，但建造萬物的是上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["摩西以僕人的身分向上帝的全家盡忠，",{"noteId":11},"為將來要宣告的事作見證。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但基督是以兒子的身分忠心治理上帝的家。我們若持定信念和引以為榮的盼望，就是祂的家了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["不可存剛硬的心"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因此，正如聖靈說：",{"text":"「你們今日若聽見祂的聲音，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不可心裡頑固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像從前在曠野試探祂、悖逆祂一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的祖先雖然在那裡觀看我的作為四十年之久，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻仍然試我、探我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我向那世代的人發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：『他們心向歧途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不認識我的道路。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我憤然起誓說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『他們絕不可進入我的安息。』","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":"」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["弟兄姊妹，要謹慎，免得你們當中有人心存惡念，不肯相信，背棄了永活的上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["趁著還有今日，要天天互相勸勉，免得有人被罪迷惑，心裡變得剛硬。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["如果我們將起初的信念堅持到底，便在基督裡有份了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["聖經上說：",{"text":"「你們今日若聽見祂的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不可心裡頑固，像從前悖逆祂一樣。」","poem":1},{"noteId":13}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["聽見祂的聲音卻又悖逆祂的是誰呢？不就是摩西從埃及領出來的那些人嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["四十年之久惹上帝發怒的是誰呢？不就是那些犯罪作惡並倒斃在曠野的人嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["上帝起誓不准誰進入祂的安息呢？不就是那些不肯順從的人嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["可見，他們不能進入上帝的安息是因為不信的緣故。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"民數記12·7。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":5}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇95·7‑11。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":11}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇95·7、8。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}